    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>An Org Loom canvas: visual workspace of Salesforce records with layout and metadata. The encrypted canvas body lives in a ContentDocument linked to this record via ContentDocumentLink with ShareType='I', so the file inherits visibility from the record share. This record is the unit of sharing; admins grant access here, not on the file.</description>
